Appropriate foreign keys, indexes and constraints shall be defined.

Game operations involving guesses and attempt counts shall use database transactions and appropriate concurrency controls.

6.6 API independence

The complete game shall be playable using REST API calls alone.

The API shall not depend on a browser or frontend implementation.

Future Android, iOS and other clients shall use the same API.


